# Download counter storage (optional).
#
# The counter only ever stores two aggregate integers (chrome / edge) — no IPs,
# no cookies, no per-user data. Locally, `npm run dev` falls back to a
# git-ignored JSON file, so no configuration is needed for development.
#
# In production the /api functions need a Redis REST endpoint. Provide the
# credentials from either the Upstash or the Vercel KV integration.
# Without them the download redirects still work; the badge just stays hidden.
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
KV_REST_API_URL=
KV_REST_API_TOKEN=
